      "body": "The board of directors of Valiant Communications Limited meeting held on May 30, 2026, Dividend for the financial year 2025-26 of INR 1.50 (15%) per equity share of the face value of INR 10 each, on the expanded paid-up capital. The total dividend outgo for financial year 2025-26 shall be higher by 50% than the previous year, commensurate with the increase in the number of equity shares on account of the Bonus Issue in ratio 1:2 The recommended dividend shall be subject to the approval of the shareholders at the upcoming 33rd Annual General Meeting (AGM) of the Company. The dividend would be paid within 30 days from the date of its declaration at the AGM.",
